{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-5","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：立方与整数","englishTitle":"If a cube number by multiplying any number make a cube number, the multiplied number will also be cube.","book":9,"number":5,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.5","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.5/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":5,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-5@raw-effc10e2ae14dbbc","contentId":"euclid-9-5","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"effc10e2ae14dbbc4d13215aee9790aa9ec153761f533d3d879cbee33ffa515e","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-5.statement","euclid-9-5.construction.1","euclid-9-5.construction.2","euclid-9-5.proof.1","euclid-9-5.proof.2","euclid-9-5.proof.3","euclid-9-5.proof.4","euclid-9-5.proof.5","euclid-9-5.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-5.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-5","revisionId":"euclid-9-5@raw-effc10e2ae14dbbc","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8dd55d58faed00174a8087569eeb73517244a91deb38af0a4f9e49c5e65cf549","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a cube number by multiplying any number make a cube number, the multiplied number will also be cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个立方数乘以任何数字,得出一个立方数,则乘数也将是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-5.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-5","revisionId":"euclid-9-5@raw-effc10e2ae14dbbc","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"33f6ee3f7309da4e628dc183d71c2859c99b91e6b70899f3ee4ff45b947d8e6d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the cube number A by multiplying any number B make the cube number C; I say that B is cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将立方数 A乘以B, 使立方数 C; 我说B是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-5.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-9-5","revisionId":"euclid-9-5@raw-effc10e2ae14dbbc","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"34c96e8c74cc506f92247d666cc04217adbb15587b77f0a0e874ab7a531dafc3","citations":["euclid-9-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let A by multiplying itself make D; therefore D is cube. [[IX. 3](/principles/euclid-9-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A乘以乘以D,D是立方体。 [[IX. 3](/principles/euclid-9-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-5.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-5","revisionId":"euclid-9-5@raw-effc10e2ae14dbbc","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"03a5a6ab4d224032257bde2f5ad1eb7479c55a349e4e555c61a61d0c508404e7","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since A by multiplying itself has made D, and by multiplying B has made C, therefore, as A is to B, so is D to C. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,A乘以本身就已经达到D,B乘以B,C,A比B等于D比C；A 与 B 之比等于 D 与 C 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-5.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-5","revisionId":"euclid-9-5@raw-effc10e2ae14dbbc","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f9a513faec707496070968b5965f11e00a118b70a3e3449e70abd21ecb74a6fb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since D, C are cube, they are similar solid numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D,C是立方体,它们就是相似立体数"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-5.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-5","revisionId":"euclid-9-5@raw-effc10e2ae14dbbc","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7ab814d48915e6b1f69a1f9e679d8b155590b9f71ff94f661814d88b3d12188c","citations":["euclid-8-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore two mean proportional numbers fall between D, C. [[VIII. 19](/principles/euclid-8-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,2 比例中项个数字在D到C之间。 [[VIII. 19](/principles/euclid-8-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-5.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-5","revisionId":"euclid-9-5@raw-effc10e2ae14dbbc","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8283081736e357102060a240d182c99cfe16aeb9f830bbd2a99c0401ce5d10a0","citations":["euclid-8-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as D is to C, so is A to B; therefore two mean proportional numbers fall between A, B also. [[VIII. 8](/principles/euclid-8-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D比C等于A比B,因此,2 比例中项也从A比B；D 与 C 之比等于 A 与 B 之比。 [[VIII. 8](/principles/euclid-8-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-5.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-5","revisionId":"euclid-9-5@raw-effc10e2ae14dbbc","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed68d258b648cbc13045922e53830abb3da395b98e8e0ab41425f00ab9317d7c","citations":["euclid-8-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And A is cube; therefore B is also cube. [[VIII. 23](/principles/euclid-8-23)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A是立方体, 因此B也是立方体。 [[VIII. 23](/principles/euclid-8-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-5.source","contentId":"euclid-9-5","revisionId":"euclid-9-5@raw-effc10e2ae14dbbc","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"24fdc61affb42343daf1180788374a82a4951e49514f4a47b5063ce644879324","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.5/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.5\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-5:euclid-9-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-5.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-9-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"IX. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-5:euclid-7-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-5.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"VII. 17"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-5:euclid-8-19:explicit","sourceContentId